<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classUdpDelaySim" kindref="compound">UdpDelaySim</ref> class is a proxy server which delays incoming udp packets by a specified millisecond delay before forwarding those packets on to the specified remote destination. The direction is one way, so create two separate instances/processes of <ref refid="classUdpDelaySim" kindref="compound">UdpDelaySim</ref> in order to achieve bidirectional communication such as LTP. </para>
</sect1>
